grian siar, Livvi sizär, Ludian and Veps sizar."},{"parola":"tarvas","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"ereditato","incerta":"no","significato":"aurochs","termine_origine":"*tarvas","catena":[{"codice":"urj-fin-pro","nome":"Proto-Finnic","termine":"*tarvas","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"ine-bsl-pro","nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","termine":"*taurás","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"ine-pro","nome":"Proto-Indo-European","termine":"*táwros","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Proto-Finnic *tarvas, from Proto-Balto-Slavic *taurás, from Proto-Indo-European *táwros."},{"parola":"vikat","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":1,"categoria":"ereditato","incerta":"sì","motivo_incerta":"Possibly","significato":"scythe","termine_origine":"*vik'at'ëh","catena":[{"codice":"urj-fin-pro","nome":"Proto-Finnic","termine":"*vik'at'ëh","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"ine-bsl-pro","nome":"Proto-Balto-Slavic","termine":"*vikapteš","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"ine-bsl-pro","ambiti":["militare"],"via":"","testo":"From Proto-Finnic *vik'at'ëh, possibly from Proto-Balto-Slavic *vikapteš, derived from the same verb as izkapts. Cognates include Finnish viikate, Karelian viikateh, Livonian vikārt, Ludian vikateh, Votic vikahtõ, (Mati) vikastõ, Veps vikateh and Ingrian viigade."}]}